      "id": 1,
      "text": "Warrens began as a small lumber settlement known as Warren Mills before evolving into a thriving agricultural community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://villageofwarrens.com/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community officially adopted the name Warrens in 1892 as it transitioned from a mill settlement to a rural village.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://villageofwarrens.com/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Warrens serves as the hub of a cranberry-growing region and hosts the annual Cranfest every September.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warrens%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Cranfest features over one thousand vendors and hosts the largest marching band parade in Wisconsin.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
